{"id":"ics-008","stemHtml":"<p>函数 <code>sum</code> 的参数 <code>n</code> 放在 <code>%rdi</code>，返回值放在 <code>%rax</code>。汇编是</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">sum:\n    testq %rdi, %rdi\n    jle .L2\n    pushq %rbx\n    movq %rdi, %rbx\n    leaq -1(%rdi), %rdi\n    call sum\n    addq %rbx, %rax\n    popq %rbx\n    ret\n.L2:\n    movl $0, %eax\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>(1) 这个函数计算的是什么？求 <code>sum(4)</code>。</p>\n<p>(2) 为什么把 <code>n</code> 存在 <code>%rbx</code> 里，而不是随便用一个 <code>%rcx</code>？</p>\n<p>(3) 执行 <code>sum(3)</code> 的过程中，栈上最多同时有几个返回地址、几个保存的 <code>%rbx</code>？若 <code>main</code> 调用 <code>sum</code> 前 <code>%rsp = 0x1000</code>，每层占「8 字节返回地址 + 8 字节 rbx」，求最深时的 <code>%rsp</code>。</p>\n","hintHtml":"<code>testq</code> 判断 <code>n &lt;= 0</code>，是递归的出口。注意 <code>call sum</code> 会覆盖调用者保存寄存器，<code>%rbx</code> 则是被调用者保存的。数栈深度时，别漏掉 <code>main</code> 调用 <code>sum(3)</code> 的那一次。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> 逐句看：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>testq %rdi, %rdi; jle .L2</code>：<code>n &lt;= 0</code> 时返回 0；</li>\n<li>否则先把 <code>n</code> 存进 <code>%rbx</code>，令参数变成 <code>n-1</code>，递归调用 <code>sum(n-1)</code>；</li>\n<li>返回后执行 <code>addq %rbx, %rax</code>，即把 <code>n</code> 加到 <code>sum(n-1)</code> 的结果上。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>sum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>sum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sum}(n)=n+\\text{sum}(n-1),\\qquad \\text{sum}(0)=0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sum}(n)=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}i=\\dfrac{n(n+1)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>）。于是</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sum}(4)=4+3+2+1=10.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 关键在于 <code>call sum</code> 之后还要用 <code>n</code>。<code>%rcx</code> 是<strong>调用者保存</strong>寄存器，被调用者（这里就是 <code>sum</code> 自己，以及它调用的其他函数）可以随意覆盖它，返回后 <code>%rcx</code> 里的值不可信。<code>%rbx</code> 是<strong>被调用者保存</strong>寄存器：谁要用它，谁就必须先 <code>push</code>、返回前 <code>pop</code> 恢复。这段代码正是 <code>pushq %rbx</code> 保存旧值、<code>popq %rbx</code> 恢复旧值，于是 <code>%rbx</code> 在当前帧里能稳定地保存 <code>n</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> 逐层展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>main</code> 调用 <code>sum(3)</code>：压入 1 个返回地址；</li>\n<li<code>sum(3)</code>：<code>push %rbx</code>（存 3），<code>call sum(2)</code>（压返回地址）；</li>\n<li<code>sum(2)</code>：<code>push %rbx</code>（存 2），<code>call sum(1)</code>（压返回地址）；</li>\n<li<code>sum(1)</code>：<code>push %rbx</code>（存 1），<code>call sum(0)</code>（压返回地址）；</li>\n<li<code>sum(0)</code> 直接返回，不再压栈。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最深时栈上有 <strong>4 个返回地址</strong>、<strong>3 个保存的 <code>%rbx</code></strong>（<code>sum(0)</code> 还没执行到 <code>push</code>）。</p>\n<p>地址计算：从 <code>%rsp=0x1000</code> 开始，<code>main</code> 的 <code>call</code> 减 8，之后每层减 16：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi><mn>8.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1000-8=0x0ff8,\\qquad 0x0ff8-16=0x0fe8,\\qquad 0x0fe8-16=0x0fd8,\\qquad 0x0fd8-16=0x0fc8.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">8.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>所以最深时 <code>%rsp = 0x0fc8</code>，总共用掉 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>38</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x38=56</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">38</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span></span></span></span> 字节。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是认为返回地址只有一个——每层递归调用都会压入自己的返回地址。二是把 <code>%rcx</code> 当成能跨 <code>call</code> 保留的寄存器，这样写出来的代码在递归里会拿到被覆盖的值。三是数栈深度时漏掉 <code>main</code> 的那一次调用，把返回地址数成 3 个。四是地址算成「每层 8 字节」，忘了 <code>push %rbx</code> 也要占 8 字节。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n}i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sum}(4)=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span>；(2) <code>%rbx</code> 是被调用者保存的；(3) 4 个返回地址、3 个保存的 <code>%rbx</code>，最深时 <code>%rsp</code> 为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x0fc8</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x0fc8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x0fc8</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n"}